{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36934","headline":"重过三衢哭孙员外 · 罗隐","name":"重过三衢哭孙员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烂柯山下忍重到，双桧楼前日欲残。\n华屋未移春照灼，故侯何在泪丸澜。\n不唯济物工夫大，长忆容才尺度宽。\n一恸旁人莫相笑，知音衰尽路行难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}